  "0a3388e8": {
   "build": "70425",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Disperse information as you deem necessary.\r\n\r\nTirisfal Regional Command\r\nCaptain Melrose\r\nCaptain Vachon\r\nCaptain Perrine\r\n\r\nDirectives by the order of the Highlord.\r\n\r\nCaptain Perrine, further fortify your position at the southwest tower (as designated). Additional supplies will be dispatched at a later date. In the meantime, materiel should be obtainable from the surrounding farms. Also, further reconnaissance and information",
   "time": 1791372106,
   "title": "Scarlet Crusade Documents",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "3ff87589": {
   "build": "70425",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 2,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "should be gathered about the organization of the $r in Brill.\r\n\r\nCaptain Vachon, there appears to be increased movement by the $r near the northern tower. This insurgence must be quickly and decisively dealt with.\r\n\r\nCaptain Melrose, there are concerns about the level of organization of the $r near the borders of the Plaguelands. A fresh group of men will be dispatched to your position in the coming weeks.\r\n\r\nGlory under the Light",
   "time": 1791372107,
   "title": "Scarlet Crusade Documents",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "5c3b2fb2": {
   "build": "70425",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Satisfied that the small world had been ordered and that their work was done, the Titans prepared to leave Azeroth. However, before they departed, they charged the greatest species of the world with the task of watching over Kalimdor, lest any force should threaten its perfect tranquility. In that age, there were many dragonflights. ",
   "time": 1791372566,
   "title": "Charge of the Dragonflights",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "7ca17b24": {
   "build": "70425",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Scourge have continued to slip through both the Bulwark and the eastern waystation, their numbers growing by the day. How such a failure in our defenses is allowed to persist is beyond my reckoning.\r\n\r\nAs noted in my previous reports, the paltry allotment of guards assigned to Brill is insufficient for what comes for us. It is not a matter of if we will be overrun, but when. And once Brill falls, it shall serve as the perfect staging ground to lay siege to the Undercity.\r\n\r\nIt is not my recommendation, but my demand that reinforcements be dispatched from their luxurious posts in the Undercity to defuse the situation while we still possess the opportunity.\r\n\r\n--Deathguard Dillinger",
   "time": 1791376936,
   "title": "Dillinger's Report",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "7ecb52e7": {
   "build": "70425",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 3,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Devlin despaired and sought an escape from our ill fortunes, and in doing so he made a pact with the Scourge.  I do not know what price was promised him for his betrayal, but I'm sure it was laced with lies.\r\n\r\nIf you see my brother, then flee from him.  He is a fiend.  A few nights ago he murdered two of our watchmen and let a small group of Scourge through the breach, leading them to where many more of us slept.",
   "time": 1791378157,
   "title": "Thurman's Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "a0204b07": {
   "build": "70425",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 2,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I fear my father made a grave error when he decided to remain and defend our home.  The forces of the Scourge rage through Tirisfal Glades, and although we are well fortified and well stocked, after the betrayal of my brother Devlin we lack the strength and numbers to withstand their continued assault.\r\n\r\nIf you receive this letter, Yvette, then know that Devlin is a traitor.",
   "time": 1791378156,
   "title": "Thurman's Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "d2638e1d": {
   "build": "70425",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Dearest Yvette,\r\n\r\nI will entrust this letter to our fastest runner.  I pray he can find a way through the forces surrounding us.  And I pray you read these words, for they are the last you will hear of me.\r\n\r\nMy only comfort in these dark days is the relief I feel, knowing that you are free of my fate.",
   "time": 1791378155,
   "title": "Thurman's Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "e57915c9": {
   "build": "70425",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "<Impressively, there is a barely legible carving in the remaining skin of the apple.>\r\n\r\nApple yum yum. Me pick flowers now.",
   "time": 1791376939,
   "title": "Gordo's Report",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "f268393e": {
   "build": "70425",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 4,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Their ambush was brutal.  They slew a third of us before we could take them down.  Now, we barely have enough men to watch our borders.  It is only a matter of time before our wearying guard drops and the Scourge attack.\r\n\r\nAnd although I saw Devlin's face amidst the desperate men and gaunt-faced Scourge on that cursed night, he slipped away before I could catch him.  He might be dead, or he might still live as an agent of the Scourge.\r\n\r\nEither way, he is a monster.",
   "time": 1791378157,
   "title": "Thurman's Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  }
 },
