   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I'm sure it'll serve you well.\r\n\r\nI know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.",
   "time": 1791373218,
   "title": "Camping 101: Tailoring",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "97961-complete": {
